# org-target: docs/10-19-design/10-architecture/10.19-standard-identities-and-aitia-review-traceability.org::#availability-revocation-scope-packets
# render-layout: elk; theme: 0; pad: 24; timeout: 30
direction: down
classes: {
  owner: {style.fill: "#E6F5F3"; style.stroke: "#19756C"; style.border-radius: 10}
  design: {style.fill: "#EAF2FF"; style.stroke: "#315B8A"; style.border-radius: 10}
  boundary: {style.fill: "#FFF2DD"; style.stroke: "#9B6C25"; style.border-radius: 10}
}
input: "DESIGN / existing Aitia native Scheme owners\nSame standard Profile / exact scoped project and policy\nCaptured history, actual methods and independent decisions\nNew packets are authored inputs and gold only" {class: design}
history: "HC04 / unavailable history\nKeep authenticated known failures and reusable results\nUnknown coverage is neither empty nor a fabricated counter\nWithhold p3/p4 until exact boundary is established\nArchive authority / coverage / trust-policy controls: see 90.73" {class: design}
revocation: "CR06 / revocation and actual use\nOld admission rechecks private receipt membership\nAdmission captures now; it does not advance the clock\nReturned gate remains a historical value\nSecond genuine receipt may still admit the same request" {class: owner}
scope: "BC06 / legitimate limited scope\nActual governing change authority + complete retention matrix\nNew scoped project starts its own lifecycle\nLimited review can pass while original work stays blocked\nKeep original proof/cost obligations; owner handoff: see 90.73" {class: design}
review: "DESIGN / matching evidence and request closure\nExact history boundary / observed check-revoke-use order\nOriginal obligations -> approved change -> limited review\nT/V evidence may be reusable; A and requests remain scoped\nLater full-scope follow-up references prior immutable inputs" {class: design}
race: "ACTUAL-USE BOUNDARY / qualification still required\nCheck -> revoke -> use needs actual effect/order review: see 90.73\nRevoke -> check refuses; use -> revoke preserves historical facts\nUnknown order stays unverified\nAitia stage is not action or release authority" {class: boundary}
result: "DESIGN GOLD / scoped outcomes\nOutage: content unverified, known evidence preserved\nRevoked/expired receipt: fresh explicit-time re-evaluation\nLimited scope: L admitted can coexist with W blocked\nNo new implementation, service or framework" {class: boundary}
input -> history
input -> revocation
input -> scope
history -> review
revocation -> review
scope -> review
review -> race -> result
